---
/**
 * /new-construction/mira-mar-sarasota : DEDICATED PROJECT PAGE
 *
 * Mira Mar gets its own template (instead of [slug].astro) because Ryan holds
 * the developer's October 2026 broker toolkit: approved renderings, the
 * features/amenities/fact sheets, and the full floor-plan set. Copy below uses
 * the developer's approved marketing verbiage. Three floor plans are shown;
 * the remaining plans, pricing by stack and floor, release schedule and the
 * full brochure are deliberately held back behind the request form.
 *
 * Source: Drive "miramar - oct2026 broker toolkit" (Seaward Development).
 * projects.json keeps the Mira Mar entry (custom_page: true) so the hub, area
 * pillar and comparable-project rows still pick it up.
 */
