---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonicalUrl="https://adamsonfl.com/new-construction/mira-mar-sarasota"
  ogImage={img('mira-mar-hero-front')}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>

  <!-- ───────────── HERO ───────────── -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden min-h-[88vh] flex items-end">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center" style={`background-image: url('${img('mira-mar-hero-front')}'); background-color: var(--color-black);`} />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/60 via-black/35 to-black/95" />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/75 via-black/35 to-transparent" />
    <div class="relative z-10 container pt-40 pb-16 md:pb-20">
      <p class="section-label text-[var(--color-gold)] mb-4">Featured Project &middot; South Palm Avenue, Downtown Sarasota</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-white mb-3 max-w-4xl" style="line-height: 1.05;">Mira Mar Residences</h1>
      <p class="font-display italic text-2xl md:text-3xl text-white/90 mb-5">The Last Great Address on South Palm Avenue</p>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white/75 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Seventy estate-style residences in two 18-story towers, rising behind the fully restored 1922 Mira Mar. Three and four bedrooms, 3,200 to 6,000 square feet, priced from $4,165,000.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
        <a href="#request" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-accent uppercase tracking-wider rounded bg-[var(--color-gold)] text-black hover:bg-[var(--color-gold-light)] font-semibold text-sm px-8 py-4">Request Pricing &amp; Floor Plans</a>
        <a href="#schedule" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-accent uppercase tracking-wider rounded border-2 border-white text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-black font-semibold text-sm px-8 py-4">Book a Private Tour</a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-8 font-accent text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-white/45">{credit}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ───────────── STAT STRIP ───────────── -->
  <section class="bg-black border-y border-white/10">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 divide-x divide-y lg:divide-y-0 divide-white/10">
        {stats.map((s) => (
          <div class="px-4 py-6 text-center">
            <p class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-[var(--color-gold)]">{s.value}</p>
            <p class="font-accent text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-white/50 mt-1">{s.label}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <BreadcrumbNav leafLabel="Mira Mar Residences" />

  <!-- ───────────── OVERVIEW + QUICK FACTS ───────────── -->
  <section class="section dark-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-10">
        <div class="lg:col-span-2">
          <p class="section-label text-[var(--color-cbgl-blue-light)] mb-3">Overview</p>
          <h2 class="accent-underline mb-6">A Reimagined Jewel on South Palm Avenue</h2>
          <div class="text-white/70 text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-5">
            <p>
              Since its debut in 1922, Mira Mar has stood as a testament to Sarasota's rich history and enduring elegance. Now, for the first time in a century, Sarasota's most beloved historical building is being reimagined. Rising elegantly above South Palm Avenue, the revived and resplendent Mira Mar presents a limited collection of 70 estate-style residences across two 18-story towers.
            </p>
            <p>
              Each home is designed to the highest standards, with sweeping views, refined interiors and private access to best-in-class amenities. This is more than a residence: it is a return to grace, a place where timeless architecture, coastal elegance and downtown vibrancy connect.
            </p>
            <p>
              The site is the pinnacle address on South Palm Avenue: nearly 900 feet of street frontage, 1.5 acres of land and an entire city block in the heart of downtown, one block from the corner of Palm and Main with its fine dining, cafés and galleries. The historic Mira Mar Apartments are being fully rehabilitated into high-end retail, restaurants and shops at the base of the towers.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-10 bg-black border-l-4 border-[var(--color-gold)] rounded-r-lg p-6 md:p-8">
            <p class="font-accent text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--color-gold)] mb-3">Ryan's take</p>
            <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed">
              Downtown has had bigger towers and newer towers, but it has never had a project on a full city block of South Palm with a landmark at its feet. Mira Mar is the one I point to when a client wants true pre-construction pricing, the longest runway for floor-plan and finish selection of any tower in the core, and a service model built with Forbes Travel Guide's consulting division. Seaward is a local developer with a delivered track record here (Epoch, 7 One One Palm, Park Residences on Lido Key), which matters more than anything else in condominium development. The pricing-by-floor sheet, the release calendar and the full plan set are things I walk through in person; what is on this page is the starting point.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-white/50">Ryan Adamson, PA &middot; Coldwell Banker Realty, St. Armands Circle</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <QuickFactsPanel project={project} />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ───────────── GALLERY ───────────── -->
  <section class="section dark-section-elevated" id="gallery">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-4 mb-10">
        <div>
          <p class="section-label text-[var(--color-cbgl-blue-light)] mb-3">Gallery</p>
          <h2 class="accent-underline">Inside Mira Mar</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/50 max-w-md">Developer renderings, shared with permission. Tap any image to view it full screen.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3" data-gallery>
        {gallery.map((g, i) => (
          <button
            type="button"
            class:list={['group relative overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[var(--color-gold)]', i === 0 ? 'col-span-2 row-span-2' : '']}
            data-lightbox-src={img(g.src)}
            data-lightbox-caption={g.caption}
            aria-label={`Open: ${g.caption}`}
          >
            <img src={img(g.src, i !== 0)} alt={g.alt} loading={i < 4 ? 'eager' : 'lazy'} class="w-full h-full aspect-[3/2] object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.04]" />
            <span class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent px-3 pt-8 pb-2 text-[11px] font-accent uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-white/85">{g.caption}</span>
          </button>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 font-accent text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-white/40">{credit}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ───────────── RESIDENCES ───────────── -->
  <section class="section dark-section" id="residences">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
        <div>
          <p class="section-label text-[var(--color-cbgl-blue-light)] mb-3">The Residences</p>
          <h2 class="accent-underline mb-6">A Sanctuary by the Bay</h2>
          <div class="text-white/70 text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-5 mb-8">
            <p>
              Step into a world of warm, understated opulence. Each home is adorned with natural materials, sea-inspired textures and a soft, sun-washed palette that evokes serenity and ease. Gracious open-concept floor plans are complemented by private elevator access, expansive outdoor terraces and meticulously curated details, from designer fixtures to artisan finishes.
            </p>
            <p>
              The heart of each residence, the chef's kitchen, is a true gathering space: marble countertops, custom-paneled Sub-Zero and Wolf appliances, and a grand island. The Owner's Suite offers a private retreat with spa-inspired ensuite baths, oversized soaking tubs, luminous stone finishes and access to peaceful terraces.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            <button type="button" class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-lg" data-lightbox-src={img('mira-mar-owners-bedroom')} data-lightbox-caption="Owners' bedroom, penthouse">
              <img src={img('mira-mar-owners-bedroom', true)} alt="Owners' bedroom with bay views" loading="lazy" class="w-full aspect-[3/2] object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.04]" />
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-lg" data-lightbox-src={img('mira-mar-terrace')} data-lightbox-caption="Private terrace">
